1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,390
Underground, nothing loads.

2
00:00:03,268 --> 00:00:04,907
Is anyone's news loading?

3
00:00:04,907 --> 00:00:06,507
Mine was ready last night.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,800
Overnight, my own AI agent turns my brief into cards for my glasses.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,060
Swipe the ring to skim. One card, one glance.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,050
Want more? Hold the ring, and the deep dive plays in my headphones.

7
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:22,230
I write the brief. My agent researches, writes, and checks every card.

8
00:00:23,584 --> 00:00:24,583
It loaded!

9
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:26,243
Oh, this is my stop.

10
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,840
G2 Digest. Your brief, ready before the train.
